out, if you override `_init` *with required arguments* things won't work, this is documented, you need to have default arguments\r\n\r\nBut again this is off topic as this isn't about the general case, that's already documented in `_init`, if there's some issue with that please open an issue specific to that","created_at":"2025-04-09T15:56:14Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T15:56:14Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102123#discussion_r2035674938","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102123","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2035674938"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102123#discussion_r2035674938"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102123"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2035674938/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":765,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2033523992,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2035680117","pull_request_review_id":2753994710,"id":2035680117,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc55VgN1","diff_hunk":"@@ -762,6 +762,7 @@\n \t\t\t\t@rpc(\"authority\", \"call_remote\", \"unreliable\", 0) # Equivalent to @rpc\n \t\t\t\tfunc fn_default(): pass\n \t\t\t\t[/codeblock]\n+\t\t\t\t[b]Note:[/b] Methods annotated with [code]@rpc[/code] cannot take objects with [method Object._init] defined with required parameters. See [code]_init[/code]'s documentation for details.","path":"modules/gdscript/doc_classes/@GDScript.xml","commit_id":"2253c0f47048b5df978bd83ba50770a24f9eab73","original_commit_id":"3f406a0bea58a90055ad9bbe421be08db70f2cf3","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Here is the minimal reproduction steps,  made a resource with arguments on _init without default arguments and created an instance of it with the **Create new Resource** button, and got an error because of the unexpected method signature, since godot editor will not send any argument to _init()\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/52cf212b-4332-4847-a722-c36e3da32d84)\r\n\r\nThe script:\r\n\r\n```\r\n@tool\r\nextends Resource\r\nclass_name MyResource\r\n\r\n@export var some_int: int\r\n@export var some_string: String\r\n\r\nfunc _init(arg1: int, arg2: String) -> void:\r\n\tsome_int = arg1\r\n\tsome_string = arg2\r\n```\r\n","created_at":"2025-04-09T15:59:10Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T15:59:34Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102123#discussion_r2035680117","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102123","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2035680117"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102123#discussion_r2035680117"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102123"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2035680117/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":765,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2033523992,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2035685971","pull_request_review_id":2754004633,"id":2035685971,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc55VhpT","diff_hunk":"@@ -762,6 +762,7 @@\n \t\t\t\t@rpc(\"authority\", \"call_remote\", \"unreliable\", 0) # Equivalent to @rpc\n \t\t\t\tfunc fn_default(): pass\n \t\t\t\t[/codeblock]\n+\t\t\t\t[b]Note:[/b] Methods annotated with [code]@rpc[/code] cannot take objects with [method Object._init] defined with required parameters. See [code]_init[/code]'s documentation for details.","path":"modules/gdscript/doc_classes/@GDScript.xml","commit_id":"2253c0f47048b5df978bd83ba50770a24f9eab73","original_commit_id":"3f406a0bea58a90055ad9bbe421be08db70f2cf3","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Yes, this is [documented](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_object.html#class-object-private-method-init):\r\n> If `_init()` is defined with required parameters, the Object with script may only be created directly. If any other means (such as `PackedScene.instantiate()` or `Node.duplicate()`) are used, the script's initialization will fail.\r\n\r\nThis is already documented, has explicit errors, and is unrelated to this PR which is specifically about `@rpc`\r\n\r\nYou fix with with just:\r\n```gdscript\r\n@tool\r\nextends Resource\r\nclass_name MyResource\r\n\r\n@export var some_int: int\r\n@export var some_string: String\r\n\r\nfunc _init(arg1: int = 0, arg2: String = \"\") -> void:\r\n\tsome_int = arg1\r\n\tsome_string = arg2\r\n```\r\nOr some appropriate default","created_at":"2025-04-09T16:02:46Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T16:03:49Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102123#discussion_r2035685971","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102123","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2035685971"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102123#discussion_r2035685971"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102123"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2035685971/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":765,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2033523992,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]